    <statement><p>Let <m>\&gt;f(x) = -2x^{2}</m>.</p>
<p>a) Find <m>\&gt;f(x+h)</m>: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>b) Find <m>\&gt;f(x+h)-f(x)</m>: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p>c) Find <m>\&gt; \frac {f(x+h)-f(x)} {h}</m>: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p>d) Find <m>\&gt; f'(x)</m>: <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-2\mathopen{}\left(x+h\right)^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2x^{2}-2\mathopen{}\left(x+h\right)^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{2x^{2}-2\mathopen{}\left(x+h\right)^{2}}{h}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-\left(4x\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
